  "text" : {
    "status" : "extensions",
    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ng-hiv-eac-intervention-tools-vs</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-eac-intervention-tools-vs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-eac-intervention-tools-vs\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html\"><code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-hiv-eac-form-cs</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version &#x1F4E6;0.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-eac-form-cs-tool-pill-box\">tool-pill-box</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Pill box</td><td>A pill box was provided or recommended as an adherence aid.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-eac-form-cs-tool-calendar\">tool-calendar</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Calendar</td><td>A calendar was provided or recommended as an adherence aid.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-eac-form-cs-tool-incentive-calendar-paediatric\">tool-incentive-calendar-paediatric</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Incentive calendar (paediatric)</td><td>A paediatric incentive calendar was provided or recommended.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-eac-form-cs-tool-arv-swallowing-instruction\">tool-arv-swallowing-instruction</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">ARV swallowing instruction</td><td>Instruction on swallowing or administering ARV medicines was provided.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-eac-form-cs-tool-written-instructions\">tool-written-instructions</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Written instructions</td><td>Written medication or adherence instructions were provided.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-eac-form-cs-tool-phone-call-sms\">tool-phone-call-sms</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Phone calls or SMS</td><td>Phone calls or SMS messages were used or planned as adherence reminders.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-eac-form-cs-tool-alarms\">tool-alarms</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Alarms</td><td>An alarm or electronic reminder was used or recommended.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-eac-form-cs-tool-other\">tool-other</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Other intervention tool</td><td>An adherence tool not represented by another code; specify separately.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
